.TH "libnvme" 9 "enum nvme_id_ctrl_avscc" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
enum nvme_id_ctrl_avscc \- Flags indicating the configuration settings for Admin Vendor Specific command handling.
.SH SYNOPSIS
enum nvme_id_ctrl_avscc {
.br
.BI "    NVME_CTRL_AVSCC_VSCF_SHIFT"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVME_CTRL_AVSCC_VSCF_MASK"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVME_CTRL_AVSCC_VSCF"

};
.SH Constants
.IP "NVME_CTRL_AVSCC_VSCF_SHIFT" 12
VSCF shift
.IP "NVME_CTRL_AVSCC_VSCF_MASK" 12
VSCF mask
.IP "NVME_CTRL_AVSCC_VSCF" 12
If set, all Admin Vendor Specific Commands use
the optional vendor specific command format with
NDT and NDM fields.
